WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.933
Week 30: Por, Para, Passive, and Impersonal Se. explain purpose and cause describe processes report institutional action

2
00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:15.049
Mission brief. Explain how a public service works, why it changed, and who is affected.

3
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:24.603
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.603 --> 00:00:32.491
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:41.018
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:41.018 --> 00:01:09.793
Model language. La medida fue aprobada por el consejo. — The measure was approved by the council. Se publicaron los resultados ayer. — The results were published yesterday. Trabajamos para mejorar el acceso. — We work to improve access. El servicio cerró por falta de fondos. — The service closed because of a lack of funding. Se requiere identificación para entrar. — Identification is required to enter.

7
00:01:09.793 --> 00:01:19.713
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
